meta {
  name: 09_DeletedParties
  seq: 9
}

docs {
  Scenario: The retention window for a deleted sole proprietorship

    Given the accounting firm has two clients that are deleted sole proprietorships
    Then both are returned marked as deleted
    And the owner of the one deleted inside the retention window is an authorized party
    And the owner of the one deleted before the window is not

  The two fixtures were deleted on different dates. The steps compare the deletion date in
  the fixture against the retention window rather than against a fixed calendar date, so
  the expectation follows the rule as time passes.
}
